   "titulo": "Greet according to the time",
   "texto": [
    "**早上好** and **早安** are «Good morning.»; **下午好**, «Good afternoon.»; **晚上好**, «Good night.» as a greeting; **晚安** is said to say goodbye to go to sleep. **中午好** is a possible greeting at noon.",
